        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "H1 2026 中报 disclosed 2026-08-28 (evening) / reported 08-29:\n- 营收 124.20 亿, +7.38%\n- 归母净利 14.88 亿, **-5.86%** (去年同期 15.81 亿)\n- 扣非 14.37 亿, -8.24%\n- 经营现金流 26.57 亿, -2.24%\n- EPS 0.31 元, -6.06%\n- 拟 10 派 2.7 元（中期分红，每股 0.27 元）\n- 线上销售 27.31 亿, +18.31%\n\nKey fundamental changes vs. baseline (2026-08-10 report based on 2025 annual + 2026Q1):\n- 2026Q1: 营收 +7.66%, 归母 +1.51%. H1: 营收 +7.38%, 归母 -5.86%. That means Q2 was weak: Q2 营收 = 124.20-66.61 = 57.59 亿, +7.1%? Let me compute: 2025H1 营收 115.67 亿 (124.20/1.0738 = 115.67). 2025Q2 营收 = 115.67 - 61.87 (2025Q1)... let me compute from data. 2026Q1 营收 66.61 亿 (+7.66%) → 2025Q1 = 66.61/1.0766 = 61.87 亿. 2025H1 = 124.20/1.0738 = 115.67 亿 → 2025Q2 = 53.80 亿. 2026Q2 = 124.20 - 66.61 = 57.59 亿, +7.05% YoY.\n- 归母: 2026H1 14.88 vs 2025H1 15.81 → Q1 9.49 (+1.51%) → 2025Q1 = 9.35. 2025Q2 = 15.81-9.35 = 6.46. 2026Q2 = 14.88-9.49 = 5.39, **-16.6% YoY**. That's a meaningful Q2 profit decline!\n- 扣非: Q1 扣非? 2026Q1 扣非约 9.19? Let me not over-compute; agents will do it.\n\nSo fundamentals DID change materially: H1 归母 -5.86%, Q2 single quarter -16.6%, 扣非 -8.24%. This is 业绩下滑 evidence → per anti-anchoring rule, price targets CAN be adjusted down (with evidence listed), but must not reference stock price.\n\nAlso: 中期分红 0.27 元/股 (vs. 2025 中期 0.23). \n\nAlso new: PE-TTM now 13.74 (Tencent) at 5.95.\n\nBaseline prices:\n- 段永平 5.3 / 4.6\n- 巴菲特 5.12 / 4.10\n- 芒格 5.80 / 5.00\n- 李录 4.8 / 4.0\n\nNow, the 反锚定 rule: fundamentals deteriorated (H1 profit -5.86%, Q2 -16.6% single quarter, 扣非 -8.24%) → price targets may be lowered with evidence. Each view must independently decide.\n\nOld reports anticipated \"8月29日半年报与H股定价后须按新股本重算\" — need to check H-share IPO progress too.\n\nPlan per memory: \n1. Pre-check WebSearch permission (per skill step 1¾: grep settings for WebSearch)\n2. Launch 4 background agents (no name, no team) — memory says use 无 name 的后台 Agent 替代团队模式\n3. Each agent: read own old report, verify fundamentals, run financial_rigor, derive independently, output to fixed filename (覆盖)\n4. Team-lead runs cross-validate and embeds\n5. Verify output files, print RESEARCH_DONE\n\nLet me check WebSearch permission whitelist first, and also check the financial_rigor tool exists. Also check whether there's an H-share IPO update (agents will search). \n\nPer the memory env_tool_permissions note: \"Agent 带 name 参数会报 No active team；investment-team 用无 name 的后台 Agent 替代团队模式\". So I launch 4 general-purpose agents with run_in_background: true, no name, no team_name.\n\nLet me check permissions quickly and verify financial_rigor.py exists."
      }
