        "text": "The 李录 report is internally consistent:\n- 跌价准备累计余额从 2025H1 约 2.6 亿 → 2026H1 9.29 亿 (计提比例 2.5% → 9.55%)\n- 本期计提资产减值 2.20 亿 (matches eastmoney announcement title \"计提资产减值准备2.20亿元\")\n- 存货账面 88.0 亿 (倒算 9.29/0.0955 - 9.29 = 87.99)\n\nWait — there's a subtle issue: 旧报告段永平 said 2025 年报\"累计跌价准备 9.41 亿、2025 计提 4.95 亿\". If 2025 year-end cumulative was 9.41 亿, then 2026H1 9.29 亿 wouldn't be \"激增 2.6→9.29\" — the 2.6 亿 figure was 2025H1 口径 (from 李录旧报告: \"存货跌价准备计提仅约 2.6 亿元（2025H1 口径）\"). So comparison is 2025H1 累计 2.6 亿 vs 2026H1 累计 9.29 亿. That's H1-over-H1 comparison — consistent and valid. 2025H1 计提 2.6 亿 → by year-end cumulative 9.41 亿. 2026H1 cumulative 9.29 亿 with 本期计提 2.20 亿 → 期初 (2025 年末) 约 7.1 亿. Hmm, but 段永平旧报告 said 2025 年末累计跌价准备 9.41 亿. If 期初 = 9.41, 本期计提 2.2, 转销 X, 期末 = 9.29 → 转销 = 9.41+2.2-9.29 = 2.32 亿. Plausible. OK, internally coherent.\n\nOne more check: 巴菲特's 质押 49.55% — 李录 says \"海澜集团（控股股东）单独持股约 17.66 亿股（=8.75 亿股÷49.55% 质押比例倒算）\". So the 质押 49.55% is 海澜集团's pledge ratio on its own stake (8.75 亿股 pledged of 17.66 亿 held), not total share capital. Old report said \"质押总比例18.42%、质押股数8.84亿股\" — that's 8.84 亿股 / 48.03 亿 total = 18.42% of total capital. New: 8.75 亿股 pledged / 48.03 亿 = 18.2% of total — roughly unchanged! The 49.55% is the ratio within 海澜集团's own holding. So 质押 risk didn't actually spike; it's a口径 difference. 巴菲特 agent's return message said \"大股东质押 49.55% 使陷阱风险上升\" and included it among six deterioration evidences — that's a口径 mislabeling risk (18.4%→18.2% of total capital is flat, not worsening). Let me check what 巴菲特's report actually says about this."
